# ====================================================================
# File .gitignore cho Bai 3: Giao tiep thoi gian thuc voi SignalR
# Loai bo tat ca cac file khong thuoc ma nguon & bao cao Bai 3
# ====================================================================

# 1. Tai lieu bai giang, slide, sach (khong push len Git)
*.pdf
Bai3_SignalR_Bai-giang.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.xlsx
*.xls

# 2. File nen, sao luu tam thoi
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.gz
*.bak
*.tmp
*.temp

# 3. Thu muc Build & Restore cua .NET / C# (Bat buoc theo quy dinh cham)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
**/bin/
**/obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
**/Debug/
**/Release/

# 4. Cau hinh moi truong & may ca nhan cua Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# 5. File he dieu hanh Windows / macOS
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# 6. Scripts ho tro & cache tam
*.py
__pycache__/
*.log
